    {
      "id": "instructions",
      "name": "Read before enabling",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -430
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1000,
        "height": 350,
        "content": "## Greenhouse, Lever & Ashby job changes\n1. Import this workflow. It is inactive.\n2. Configure Settings; create the named Google Sheets tab with the supplied CSV headers.\n3. On every HTTP node, select the SAME Header Auth credential: Authorization = Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN. Never paste a token into the workflow JSON.\n4. Select your Google Sheets credential. Email is optional and disabled by default; configure SMTP + addresses before enabling it.\n5. Run manually, inspect saved rows, then enable the daily schedule (09:00 UTC).\n6. First run is a baseline. Later runs compare the same input and history. Avoid overlapping executions.\nDefault result fee: up to $0.20 per run; explicit $0.25 run cap. Separate n8n/account storage costs may apply. If saving fails, retry from Read saved dataset for the SAME run, because Actor history has already advanced.\nGuide: https://github.com/CRNO22/apify-workflow-examples/blob/main/docs/jobs-to-sheets.md"
      }
    }
